// the mobile frame in 390 (x -367.5, the same path 189 to the left), and the desktop frame scales it
// 1.28 to 1440 x 960 behind a 750 hero (y -105). So the three are three viewBoxes on this path (in
// the tablet frame's coordinates), not three traces. The base is the frame's #FFD24A and the field
